{"id":"a858639a199f0460","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-configuration-space.md","title":"Configuration Space","display":"df-configuration-space — Configuration Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-configuration-space","aliases":["58-df-configuration-space","Configuration Space"],"display":"df-configuration-space — Configuration Space","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-configuration-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-configuration-space</span><span>Configuration Space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-configuration-space — Configuration Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,M,n\\in V\">\\(C,M,n\\in V\\)</span> (参数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConfigurationSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ConfigurationSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (本文件定义的有序配置空间关系)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conf}_n(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Conf}_n(M)\\)</span> (兼容集合记号)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}configuration\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConfigurationSpace}_S(C,M,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\nC=\\{x\\in M^n\\mid\\forall i,j\\in n\\;(i\\ne j\\to x(i)\\ne x(j))\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}configuration\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConfigurationSpace}_S(C,M,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\nC=\\{x\\in M^n\\mid\\forall i,j\\in n\\;(i\\ne j\\to x(i)\\ne x(j))\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}configuration\\text{-}space\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Conf}_n(M)=C\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ConfigurationSpace}_S(C,M,n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}configuration\\text{-}space\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Conf}_n(M)=C\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ConfigurationSpace}_S(C,M,n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件采用有序（带标号）配置；该集合只依赖载体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>，拓扑结构由下游按需赋予。无序配置为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conf}_n(M)/S_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Conf}_n(M)/S_n\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>平面有序配置的基本群是纯辫群 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_n\">\\(P_n\\)</span>；无序配置的基本群才是辫群 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_n\">\\(B_n\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>Fadell–Neuwirth 给出纤维化，通常不产生原文件声称的全局乘积同伦等价。</li>\n<li>Factorial growth: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dim \\operatorname{Conf}_n(M) = n \\cdot \\dim M\">\\(\\dim \\operatorname{Conf}_n(M) = n \\cdot \\dim M\\)</span>; topological complexity grows fast</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Birman, Braids, Links, and Mapping Class Groups</li>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C,M,n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConfigurationSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conf}_n(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}configuration\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConfigurationSpace}_S(C,M,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\nC=\\{x\\in M^n\\mid\\forall i,j\\in n\\;(i\\ne j\\to x(i)\\ne x(j))\\}\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}configuration\\text{-}space\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Conf}_n(M)=C\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ConfigurationSpace}_S(C,M,n)","display":true},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conf}_n(M)/S_n","display":false},{"tex":"P_n","display":false},{"tex":"B_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\dim \\operatorname{Conf}_n(M) = n \\cdot \\dim M","display":false}],"bytes":1450,"backlinks":[{"id":"f7c401f974e8f1d4","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ConfigurationSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-configuration-space]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-346","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-configuration-space.md|58-df-configuration-space]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3"]}